      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The vipers spray venom from their fangs in a defensive display. Each creature in a 10ft Cone is exposed to viper swarm venom but gains a +2 circumstance bonus to its initial saving throw against the poison.</p>",
